<%# The grid of every card. From 1180px the RAPPORT in a 220px column, the
    grid, then the card detail in a 340px column; from 900px the grid and
    the detail in a 300px column; under 900px the grid alone, a slot
    opening its card's detail page, and on the phone one column, the
    RAPPORT folded above the grid, two cards wide. Above the grid, the
    search and the folded FILTRES zone (library/filters), then the grid and
    the detail in a frame the filters reload, which empties the detail.
    From 900px a slot opens its card's detail in the `card-detail` frame
    (collection-detail controller); until then the frame holds the
    detail's layout, empty (cards/detail_waiting). When the grid shows new
    cards to their player, the collection-seen controller posts the latest
    gain shown, once the page is rendered.
    - heading: the page's name;
    - grid: the Catalog::CollectionGrid; slots, pagy: its page, context:
      the filters its links carry (library/grid);
    - unique, games_by_rarity, tier_counts: the viewer's figures;
    - seen_up_to: the latest gain among the new cards shown, or nil;
    - pagy also gives the count announced by the status line;
    - states, states_asked, query, set_filter: the filters on and the set
      group (library/filters). %>
<div class="collection" data-controller="collection-detail"
  data-action="click->collection-detail#open turbo:frame-load->collection-detail#loaded">
  <h1 class="visually-hidden"><%= heading %></h1>
  <aside class="collection__aside" aria-labelledby="collection-report-title">
    <%= render "library/report", counts: tier_counts, games: games_by_rarity, unique: unique %>
  </aside>
  <section class="collection__main" aria-label="<%= heading %>">
    <%= render "library/filters", grid:, states:, states_asked:, query:, set_filter: set_filter %>
    <%= turbo_frame_tag "collection-results", target: "_top", class: "collection-results", data: { turbo_action: "replace" } do %>
      <div class="collection-results__grid">
        <p class="visually-hidden" role="status"><%= t("library.grid.result", count: pagy.count) %></p>
        <%= render "library/grid", context:, slots:, pagy: pagy %>
        <% if seen_up_to %>
          <div hidden data-controller="collection-seen" data-collection-seen-url-value="<%= library_seen_path %>"
            data-collection-seen-up-to-value="<%= seen_up_to.utc.iso8601(6) %>"></div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
      <%= turbo_frame_tag "card-detail", target: "_top", class: "collection-detail" do %>
        <%= render "cards/detail_waiting", signed_in: current_player.present? %>
      <% end %>
    <% end %>
  </section>
</div>
